OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA band of
OL,6,Fcloud and rain, locally heavy, will
OL,7,Fmove southeast across the region this
OL,8,Fevening and overnight, gradually
OL,9,Fclearing by dawn. Becoming drier with
OL,10,Fclearer spells following on behind.
OL,11,FFeeling noticeably cooler behind the
OL,12,Frain with lighter winds.
OL,13,
OL,14,CFriday:FA chilly start to Friday with
OL,15,Fplenty of sunny spells. Perhaps a few
OL,16,Fshowers further north and west later.
OL,17,FNoticeably cooler in a northwesterly
OL,18,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
