OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells through the
OL,7,Fweekend. Chilly nights bring a risk of
OL,8,Ffrost and patchy fog. Breezier Sunday,
OL,9,Fwith the odd shower possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
